OL,3,AAt least 20 dead after fire on cargo
OL,4,Aship in eastern China, state media
OL,5,Areport
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 20 people have been killed in
OL,8,Fa fire on a foreign-flagged cargo ship
OL,9,Fdocked at a port in eastern China,
OL,10,Faccording to Chinese state broadcaster
OL,11,FCCTV.
OL,13,FOf the 42 people on board, 17 were
OL,14,Fevacuated of which five are in hospital
OL,15,Fin stable condition, CCTV says.
OL,17,FPresident Xi Jinping earlier called for
OL,18,F"all out" search and rescue efforts
OL,19,Fwhile Premier Li Qiang called for those
OL,20,Ftrapped to be rescued, stressing the
OL,21,Fneed to "prevent secondary disasters".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
