OL,3,AAt least 20 dead after fire on cargo
OL,4,Aship in eastern China, state media
OL,5,Areport
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe vessel was undergoing maintenance
OL,8,Fat a shipyard in the city of Qingdao
OL,9,Fwhen the blaze erupted at around 11:15
OL,10,Flocal time (03:15 GMT).
